{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "此命出生家境如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **八字格局与日主强弱**：  \n   日主戊土生于亥月（水旺财星当令），但日支午火为帝旺羊刃，时柱丁巳正偏印生身，月干己土劫财帮身，年柱辛卯为虚浮伤官与正官。全局火土印比成势，日主身旺，喜水木为用，忌火土。\n\n2. **家境关键信息**：  \n   - **财星（父）**：月令亥水为偏财（父亲），但被月干己土劫财盖头，又被时支巳火冲克，财星受损严重，父亲财运不佳，难以致富。  \n   - **官星（权力）**：年支卯木正官为用，但被年干辛金伤官直克（伤官见官），官星无力，父母难有官职。  \n   - **印星（母）**：午火正印在日支，丁巳印星在时柱，印星强旺，母缘深但印多为忌，母亲虽有能力，但未必显贵，可能为基层文职或村干部。  \n   - **年柱祖业**：辛卯伤官见官，祖上易有官非破耗，家境基础薄弱。\n\n3. **综合推断**：  \n   财官为用却被制，劫印成势为忌，出生家境清贫，父母非富非贵。建国初期（1951年）广东地区，此类格局多对应普通农民家庭，与“贫穷”选项相符。\n\n### 最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 18804, "response_id": "76afd665-ffe8-4a18-a75c-76d3232aec49", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 211, "completion_tokens": 1111, "total_tokens": 1322, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 754}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 211}}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", "domain": "relationship", "question": "婚姻如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字推算：日主戊土生于亥月，月柱己亥劫财坐财，年柱辛卯伤官坐正官，日支午火印星，时柱丁巳印星。女命以官杀为夫星，年支卯木为正官，然而辛金伤官盖头克制卯木，形成“伤官见官”，主婚姻不利，有克夫之象。日主戊土得印星生扶，身旺印旺，夫妻宫为午火，夫星卯木生午火，夫星势弱受制。官星孤悬年支，又被伤官紧克，亥卯虽半合木局，但亥水被己土盖头，生官不力。全局火土燥烈，官星无财生、反被伤，夫星受损严重，易应夫早亡之象。因此婚姻极不顺，丈夫恐难长寿。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 16259, "response_id": "9aba09de-737a-4357-9f29-d62c4c3c5451", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 207, "completion_tokens": 908, "total_tokens": 1115, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 703}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 79}}
