{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q5", "domain": "unknown", "question": "1993年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字，日主戊土生于亥月，得日支午火、时柱丁巳印星生扶，身偏旺，喜金水木。夫星为木（官星），原局年支卯木为正官，但被月干辛金伤官盖头，已伏婚姻不顺之兆。\n\n1993年癸酉年，命主正行癸卯大运。大运与流年天干双癸水财星，地支双卯冲一酉。酉金为伤官，卯木为官星（夫星），形成“伤官见官”且“双卯冲一酉”之局，夫星被冲克极重。年支、大运之卯木官星俱损，主丈夫有重大灾劫。同时，原局时支巳与流年酉半合金局，增强伤官之力，加剧对夫星的克伐。综合推断，此年丈夫极可能因病而亡。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 13958, "response_id": "4fb9389a-14ae-46d5-acc2-5f5578027776", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 215, "completion_tokens": 933, "total_tokens": 1148, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 720}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 87}}
{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", "domain": "health", "question": "2022年至现在，命主的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **大运排定**  \n   命主生于丁卯年（阴年），女性为阴年女，大运顺排。月柱丙午，顺行丁未、戊申、己酉、庚戌等。约11岁起运，当前所处大运为：31-40岁 **己酉**（约2017-2027年）。\n\n2. **原局特点**  \n   乙木日主坐卯木强根，生于午月，木火两旺。月柱丙午，时支又见午火，全局火炎土燥；时干透壬水正印调候，但坐午火无根，力量衰微。地支卯午相破，午午自刑，木火过旺，水弱易枯，先天存在肝木、血液、心血管及肾水代谢方面的隐患。\n\n3. **大运分析**  \n   己酉大运，己土偏财泄火，酉金七杀直冲日支卯木（卯酉冲）。日主之根被冲，七杀攻身，代表压力、意外伤灾、手术开刀等象。金木交战，尤损肝胆、筋骨，此十年健康风险显著升高。\n\n4. **流年应期**  \n   - **2022壬寅年**：壬水透干，但大运财星坏印，水弱被耗；寅木助日主，然寅午合火，加重火势，水火交战，病痛之始。  \n   - **2023癸卯年**：癸水偏印透出，大运己土回克，水难为用；流年卯木与大运酉金形成“二卯冲一酉”，金木冲战达到极致。日支逢冲，身根动摇，是典型的开刀手术、意外血光、甚至危及生命的年份。  \n   - **2024甲辰年**：甲木帮身，辰酉合金，增强七杀之力，木仍受克，处于术后恢复或仍有健康反复的阶段。  \n\n综合来看，2022年至今，命主因大运流年剧烈冲克，经历了一次严重的健康危机，手术且波及生命存亡的可能性极高。\n\n### 最终答案\nB", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R0_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 24422, "response_id": "bfe7cc0f-521f-45a1-95ab-2820aef7a773", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 254, "completion_tokens": 1529, "total_tokens": 1783, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1044}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_